{"id":"631571","name":"蒜拌黄瓜鸡蛋","author":"红袖添香v","authorId":"11598100","desc":"","cover":"images/631571/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"4个"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"2个"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"1头"}],"sub":[{"name":"生抽","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"凉拌醋","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"香油","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/631571/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"准备好调料。","img":"images/631571/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"鸡蛋清洗干净后，凉水下锅煮五分钟。","img":"images/631571/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"然后放到凉水中，这样容易剥皮。","img":"images/631571/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"黄瓜去皮、拍碎切成块。","img":"images/631571/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜剥去皮放到蒜臼子中，倒入盐，砸成蒜泥。","img":"images/631571/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入生抽。","img":"images/631571/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入凉拌醋。","img":"images/631571/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"黄瓜切好后放入碗中","img":"images/631571/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"鸡蛋去皮切成四瓣。","img":"images/631571/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"把鸡蛋放入黄瓜上面，再用匙子舀上蒜泥浇到碗里。","img":"images/631571/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后滴上香油。","img":"images/631571/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"天热来个蒜拌黄瓜鸡蛋，减脂减肥又不缺营养。","img":"images/631571/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}